---
title: ReAct Loop — Structure
layout: tree-down
hSpacing: 55
vSpacing: 120
---

question [class] "Question"
model [class] "Model" { methods: "think()" }
tools [interface] "Tools" { methods: "run(input)" }
answer [class] "Answer"

question -> model
model -> tools "action"
tools -> model "observation (loop)"
model -> answer "done"
